{
    "background_story": "In a hidden cave deep within the forest, a colony of bats thrived under the watchful eye of Everly, a majestic Vespertilio bat. Her species was known for its striking appearance and agility, but Everly's exceptional navigation skills and keen echolocation made her a leader among her kin. As the sun dipped below the horizon, Everly would take to the skies, using her acute senses to guide her colony through the darkness. With a flick of her wing, she would expertly avoid obstacles and locate the ripest fruit and insects for her family to feast on. Everly's wisdom and dedication earned her the title of 'Moonlight Sentinel,' and her colony flourished under her gentle yet fearless guidance.",
